# Research Papers

## Overview

This folder contains a collection of research papers and academic assignments completed as part of my **Bachelor of Applied Technology in Artificial Intelligence & Robotics** program. These projects demonstrate my ability to research, analyze, and communicate complex artificial intelligence concepts while exploring their practical applications across a variety of industries.

Throughout this coursework, I examined emerging AI technologies, machine learning models, intelligent automation, and the ethical considerations surrounding the development and deployment of artificial intelligence. Each research paper reflects my understanding of current AI trends, real-world implementation strategies, and the societal impact of intelligent systems.

## Areas of Study

The research in this portfolio includes topics such as:

* Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals
* Machine Learning and Deep Learning
* Natural Language Processing (NLP)
* Computer Vision
* Artificial Intelligence Agents and Automation
* Artificial General Intelligence (AGI)
* AI Ethics, Bias, Privacy, and Responsible AI
* AI and Blockchain Integration
* Emerging AI Technologies and Large Language Models (LLMs)

## Industry Applications

These research papers examine how artificial intelligence is transforming multiple industries, including:

* Healthcare
* Agriculture
* Manufacturing
* Retail
* Entertainment and Media
* Government and Public Services
* Education
* Financial Technology and Blockchain

## Skills Demonstrated

The assignments included in this folder demonstrate my ability to:

* Conduct academic and technical research
* Analyze emerging technologies and industry trends
* Evaluate real-world AI applications
