## Purpose

The purpose of this collection is to showcase my academic growth, technical knowledge, and passion for artificial intelligence. These research projects reflect the knowledge and skills I have developed throughout my coursework and demonstrate my commitment to understanding how AI can be used to create innovative, responsible, and impactful solutions for real-world problems.
